Plato. Theaetetus, translated by M. J. Levett, revised by Myles Burnyeat, with introduction by Bernard Williams. Hackett, 1992, Williams edition. English. ISBN 9780872201583.

[Publisher and edition](https://hackettpublishing.com/classics/theaetetus).

Use this translation as a modern comparison with [Jowett](Theaetetus-Jowett.lingua#r_4WKXEWKMJYVH6KAD0MDMQ31N2P) and the Greek text. Distinguish the introduction's argument from the translation and from Burnyeat's separately published, longer work on the dialogue.

**Use:** [knowledge, being, and dialectic](../research/seminars/Plato-being-and-knowledge.lingua#r_34WRXN1SRY8SZVRKRV7X3X9QWA). The literature dossier still needs sustained research on the precise disagreement being investigated.

**Access:** publisher, library, or an owned edition.
